            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>&lt;!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main --&gt;

What's Changed

New Features



pressure_at_hybrid_levels by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/776


Bug Fixes



ASV workflow tag fix by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/775

Units bug fix for interp_hybrid_to_pressure by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/781

Ensure consistent attribute behavior remains following Xarray changes by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/783

Fix vimfc lat/lon Axis by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/784


Maintenance



Initial benchmarks by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/772


Misc



Bump actions/upload-artifact from 4 to 5 in the actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/778

Fix Upstream CI installation issue by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/782

Bump actions/checkout from 5.0.0 to 5.0.1 in the actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/786

[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by @pre-commit-ci[bot] in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/779

Update release notes for v2025.11.0 by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/pull/789


Full Changelog: https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-comp/compare/v2025.10.01...v2025.11.0</gco:CharacterString>
